{"id":"n45653-1-7","stage":5,"title":"누이 · 姐妹","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n45653-1-7-1","ko":"너 어제 낯선 여자랑 같이 가던데 그 여자 누구니?","zh":"昨天看你和一个我不认识的女人一起走，她是谁？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낯선","meaning":"陌生，面生","explanation":"낯설다：陌生，面生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"낯설다","audio":"/audio/f8ed723eebf05294a03f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41324","senseId":"1","lemma":"낯설다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여자랑","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起，一同","explanation":"같이：一起，一同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가던데","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구니?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"f8ed723eebf05294","term":"낯설다","zh":"陌生，面生","audio":"/audio/f8ed723eebf05294a03f.mp3","entryId":"41324","definition":"以前未曾看见过或见过面，所以彼此不认识。","pronunciation":["낟썰다"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起，一同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"两个以上同时。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]}],"audio":"/audio/712393b1eba074b6f738.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n45653-1-7-2","ko":"내 누이야. 형제지만 별로 안 닮았지?","zh":"是我的姐妹。虽然是亲姐弟或兄妹，长得不太像吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누이야.","meaning":"姐妹","explanation":"누이：姐妹；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"누이","audio":"/audio/f4ffca83d2145e64e300.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45653","senseId":"1","lemma":"누이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형제지만","meaning":"兄弟","explanation":"형제：兄弟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"2","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닮았지?","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f4ffca83d2145e64","term":"누이","zh":"姐妹","audio":"/audio/f4ffca83d2145e64e300.mp3","entryId":"45653","definition":"用于男性指称同一父母所生或本家亲戚中的女性同辈。","pronunciation":["누이"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"由相同的父母生育或养育的子女们。","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/affaf4633ba439f4f768.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=45653","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是我的姐妹。虽然是亲姐弟或兄妹，长得不太像吧？","昨天看你和一个我不认识的女人一起走，她是谁？","为什么要买窗帘？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天看你和一个我不认识的女人一起走，她是谁？","为什么要买窗帘？","是我的姐妹。虽然是亲姐弟或兄妹，长得不太像吧？"],"answer":2}]}
